faceclaw (jimrandomh/faceclaw)
https://github.com/jimrandomh/faceclaw
Commit 2e416b53679baf3c9e312c77f53a2b41f9b62d93.

G2Settings.kt ports and modifies buildSettingsQuery,
parseSettingsFirmwareInfo, and buildFaceclawWakeControl of
native/kotlin/shared/src/commonMain/kotlin/com/faceclaw/app/g2protocol/
BleProtocol.kt, and the revision check of app/g2/firmware-compat.ts.
G2CfwStream.kt ports and modifies g2protocol/CfwTransport.kt. G2Panel.kt
ports and modifies the stockText, bbox, clear, and message builders of
g2protocol/DrawProtocol.kt and the message and call IDs of CfwMessageType.kt,
DrawCallType.kt, and DrawFlags.kt. G2RingFilter in G2EvenHub.kt ports
app/ui/input-monitor.ts. G2Battery.kt ports and modifies parseSettingsBattery,
buildCaseInfoQuery, parseCaseInfo, and CaseInfoSnapshot of BleProtocol.kt, the
case rules of updateCaseInfoLocked in session/GlassesSessionControls.kt, and
the per-arm read of readBatteries in FlashPromptFlow.kt; G2Session.kt follows
the battery poll cadence of g2protocol/ConnectionOptions.kt and
session/GlassesSessionSend.kt. The golden bytes in G2FaceclawWireTest.kt come
from tests/kotlin/src/commonTest/kotlin/com/faceclaw/app/ProtocolTest.kt and
DrawWireTest.kt, and those in G2BatteryTest.kt from GlassesSessionCoreTest.kt.

